  "worked_solution": "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(S) & ={s}_{11}{C}_{11}+{s}_{12}{C}_{12}+{s}_{13}{C}_{13}+{s}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =0\\cdot {C}_{11}+2\\cdot {C}_{12}+0\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & =2{C}_{12} \\\\  & =2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}\u2217 & 2 & \u2217 & \u2217 \\\\ 1 & \u2217 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & \u2217 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & \u2217 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(-1)^{1+2}|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-2(1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-5 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{aligned}|-0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =-2((-5\\cdot 2-4\\cdot 2)-0+0) \\\\  & =-2\\cdot (-18) \\\\  & =36\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
